WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:16.450
"What do you mean?" Kip asked Seagull.

2
00:00:16.451 --> 00:00:20.786
"Bird loves pizza crust."

3
00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:24.211
"But Bird is sick," said Seagull.

4
00:00:24.212 --> 00:00:27.257
"You should bring her some noodle soup."

5
00:00:27.258 --> 00:00:30.531
"Noodle soup?" said Kip.

6
00:00:30.532 --> 00:00:53.302
"Yes," said Seagull. "Bird will like noodle soup."

7
00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:56.576
Kip saw Pigeon.

8
00:00:56.577 --> 00:00:59.292
"Bird is sick," said Kip.

9
00:00:59.293 --> 00:01:02.237
"I'm taking a pizza crust to her."

10
00:01:02.238 --> 00:01:05.056
"Really?" said Pigeon.

11
00:01:05.057 --> 00:01:09.140
"When I'm sick I don't like to eat.

12
00:01:09.141 --> 00:01:14.109
Why don't you bring her some warm blankets?"

13
00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:16.981
"Warm blankets?" said Kip.

14
00:01:16.982 --> 00:01:34.407
"Yes," said Pigeon. "Bird will like warm blankets."

15
00:01:34.408 --> 00:01:36.721
Kip saw Squirrel.

16
00:01:36.722 --> 00:01:40.001
"Bird is sick," said Kip.

17
00:01:40.002 --> 00:01:43.208
"I'm bringing her a pizza crust."

18
00:01:43.209 --> 00:01:47.036
"Bad idea!" said Squirrel.

19
00:01:47.037 --> 00:01:50.583
"Hot tea is much better."

20
00:01:50.584 --> 00:01:53.198
"Really?" asked Kip.

21
00:01:53.199 --> 00:01:59.291
"Yes," said Squirrel. "Bird will like hot tea."

22
00:01:59.292 --> 00:02:02.166
Kip was confused.

23
00:02:02.167 --> 00:02:04.901
He didn't know what to bring Bird.

24
00:02:04.902 --> 00:02:08.226
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

25
00:02:08.227 --> 00:02:17.408
"Now I feel awful too!"
